Dear Alberto,

Thank you for AXMED-RFQ-2026-0385 and apologies for the slight delay. Please =
find our indicative offer below for the 6 lines you asked about. All prices a=
re in EUR, FCA Rotterdam (NLRTM), and hold until 16 November 2026.

1) Lowchlor 7.1% (chlorhexidine digluconate 7.1% w/w gel, 20 g tube)
   Pack: aluminium tube of 50 tubes
   Price: 0.4399 per tube
   MOQ: 1,000 packs, lead time 75 days

2) Gentaex 80 (gentamicin 80 mg / 2 mL solution for injection)
   Pack: amber glass ampoule of 100 ampoules
   Price: 0.2481 per ampoule
   MOQ: 500 packs, lead time 21 days

3) Lownida 400 (metronidazole 400 mg tablet)
   Pack: alu-alu blister of 10 tablets
   Price: 0.0221 per tablet
   MOQ: 10,000 packs, lead time 60 days

4) Lowsalb 100 (salbutamol 100 mcg/dose metered-dose inhaler, 200 doses)
   Pack: aluminium canister with actuator of 1 inhaler
   Price: 1.946 per inhaler
   MOQ: 2,000 packs, lead time 56 days

5) Lowzepam 5 (diazepam 5 mg tablet)
   Pack: pvc/alu blister of 100 tablets
   Price: 0.0065 per tablet
   MOQ: 5,000 packs, lead time 30 days

6) Lowmoxsusp 250 (amoxicillin 250 mg / 5 mL powder for oral suspension)
   Pack: hdpe bottle with measuring cup of 1 bottle
   Price: 0.4264 per bottle
   MOQ: 10,000 packs, lead time 45 days

30 days net. Serialisation to GS1 standards available on request. This quotat=
ion is an offer to treat and does not constitute a binding contract.

Happy to jump on a call if useful.

